  "name": "Question 11",
  "problem": "The vector $a$ has magnitude $3.$ What is $a\\times a?$",
  "worked_solution": "Suppose $a$ and $b$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $a\\times b=0$ if and only if $a\u2225b.$\n\nNotice that any vector is parallel to itself. So, we have $a\u2225a.$\n\nTherefore, $a\\times a=0.$",
